{# Authored glyph set for the public landing (`LAND1-01`, RCA-004).

   PRODUCT.md records "no icon set" as a deliberate absence for the APPLICATION. This set belongs
   to the marketing surface only, which `FR-091` keeps as a distinct visual world; nothing here is
   imported by `/app` or `/beta`.

   Drawn, not borrowed: no icon library, no font, no emoji, no external asset — the craft floor's
   rule and the CSP's `default-src 'none'` agree on that. One stroke weight (1.5 at a 24 viewBox)
   across every glyph, so the set reads as one hand.

   Each is a `<symbol>` in a single inert sprite, referenced by `<use>`. `currentColor` on every
   stroke means a glyph takes the colour of whatever state it marks, so the palette stays the one
   source of semantic colour.

   Every glyph is decorative: the meaning is always carried by adjacent text as well, so each
   `<use>` site sets `aria-hidden`. No information is glyph-only. #}
<svg class="glyph-sprite" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="0" height="0">
  <defs>

    {# The winged sun disc — the lintel over the hero specimen. Khepri's own emblem: the disc
       carried across the sky, which is exactly the transformation the product claims. #}
    <symbol id="g-winged-sun" viewBox="0 0 120 32">
      <circle cx="60" cy="16" r="7.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <circle cx="60" cy="16" r="3" fill="currentColor"/>
      <path d="M52 12 C40 9 26 8 6 13 C24 15 38 15 51 17" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M52 19 C40 19 26 20 10 24 C26 24 40 22 51 21" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M68 12 C80 9 94 8 114 13 C96 15 82 15 69 17" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M68 19 C80 19 94 20 110 24 C94 24 80 22 69 21" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </symbol>

    {# PROVEN — the eye. It saw the figure reconcile. #}
    <symbol id="g-proven" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
      <path d="M2 12 C6 6.5 9.5 4.5 12 4.5 C14.5 4.5 18 6.5 22 12 C18 17.5 14.5 19.5 12 19.5 C9.5 19.5 6 17.5 2 12 Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
